# Build output, live data and machine-local state.
#
# The gateway writes OpenTimestamps proofs, evidence packages and manifests into
# `psemp-gateway/data/`. That directory holds material produced by a real mailbox
# on a real machine — it is output, not source, and must never be committed.
/psemp-gateway/data/

# Reports, logs, scratch files.
/reports/
*.log
*.err
*.tmp

# Node (the repository intentionally has no runtime dependencies, so this only
# matters if someone runs a tool locally).
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Built add-on archives. Release archives are attached to GitHub Releases, not
# committed: a committed .xpi is a stale copy waiting to be installed by mistake.
*.xpi
/dist/

# Editor and OS noise.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db

# Thunderbird profile artefacts copied out for debugging.
*.msf
prefs.js.backup*
user.js.psemp-before-install
